<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="id">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Kasus 5: Simulasi Loket Tiket Bandara</title>
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;
            background-color: #e0e0e0;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
            min-height: 100vh;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 20px;
        }

        .slide {
            background-color: #f4f4f4;
            padding: 40px;
            width: 100%;
            max-width: 950px;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
            border-radius: 8px;
        }

        h1 { color: #2c3e50; margin-bottom: 5px; }
        .subtitle { color: #555; margin-bottom: 30px; font-weight: 500; font-style: italic; }

        .content-row {
            display: flex;
            gap: 20px;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
        }

        .box {
            flex: 1;
            padding: 20px;
            background-color: #ffffff;
            border-left: 5px solid #f39c12;
            min-width: 300px;
        }

        .box h2 {
            margin-top: 0;
            color: #f39c12;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 10px;
        }

        ul { line-height: 1.8; color: #333; padding-left: 20px; }
        li { margin-bottom: 8px; }

        .insight-banner {
            background-color: #ffeaa7;
            padding: 15px 20px;
            border-left: 5px solid #f39c12;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
            font-weight: 600;
            color: #2d3436;
        }

        .code-box {
            background-color: #1e1e1e;
            color: #f8f8f2;
            padding: 20px;
            border-radius: 5px;
            font-family: 'Consolas', 'Courier New', monospace;
            white-space: pre;
            overflow-x: auto;
            font-size: 0.9em;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="slide">
    <h1>Kasus 5: Simulasi Loket Tiket Bandara</h1>
    <div class="subtitle">Discrete event simulation untuk menghitung rata-rata waktu tunggu</div>

    <div class="content-row">
        <div class="box">
            <h2>💾 Komponen Simulasi</h2>
            <ul>
                <li>Queue untuk antrian penumpang</li>
                <li>Array untuk agen tiket</li>
                <li>Parameter: durasi, jumlah agen, waktu layanan, interval kedatangan</li>
                <li>Random arrival: prob = 1/betweenTime</li>
                <li>3 aturan per tick waktu</li>
            </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="box">
            <h2>📜 Aturan Simulasi</h2>
            <ul>
                <li><strong>R1:</strong> Jika penumpang tiba → enqueue</li>
                <li><strong>R2:</strong> Jika agen free & queue tidak kosong → dequeue, mulai layani</li>
                <li><strong>R3:</strong> Jika transaksi selesai → penumpang keluar, agen free</li>
                <li><strong>Avg wait</strong> = totalWait / numServed</li>
            </ul>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="insight-banner">
        Insight: menambah 1 agen (2 → 3) menurunkan avg wait dari 475 menjadi 1.14 menit!
    </div>

    <div class="code-box">
# Inti simulasi
for curTime in range(numMinutes + 1):
    handleArrival(curTime)       # penumpang tiba? → enqueue
    handleBeginService(curTime)  # agen free? → dequeue & layani
    handleEndService(curTime)    # transaksi selesai? → agen free</div>
</div>

</body>
</html>
